BT /F2 18 Tf 54 776 Td (Bare-Metal Observability Platform - Intern Onboarding ) Tj ET
BT /F2 18 Tf 54 762 Td (Guide) Tj ET
BT /F2 14 Tf 54 726 Td (What this platform does) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 696 Td (This repo runs a full observability and reliability platform on a Linux host without ) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 682 Td (Docker. Terraform installs/configures systemd services for Prometheus, Loki, Tempo, ) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 668 Td (Grafana, Alertmanager, exporters, OpenTelemetry Collector, the optional demo API, and ) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 654 Td (the DORA exporter.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 624 Td (The main goal is to move from "something is wrong" to "this endpoint/span/log line ) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 610 Td (caused it" quickly.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 580 Td (The platform usually monitors a real service configured in `terraform/terraform.tfvars`.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 566 Td ( The bundled `test-api` is only a smoke-test workload for generating known metrics, ) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 552 Td (logs, traces, latency, and errors.) Tj ET
BT /F2 14 Tf 54 516 Td (How the services work together) Tj ET
BT /F3 9 Tf 62 470 Td (monitored service -> metrics -> Prometheus) Tj ET
BT /F3 9 Tf 62 456 Td (monitored service -> health URL -> Blackbox Exporter -> Prometheus) Tj ET
BT /F3 9 Tf 62 442 Td (monitored service -> traces/logs -> OpenTelemetry Collector -> Tempo/Loki) Tj ET
BT /F3 9 Tf 62 428 Td (systemd journals -> OpenTelemetry Collector -> Loki) Tj ET
BT /F3 9 Tf 62 414 Td (Prometheus alerts -> Alertmanager -> Slack #detrudr-alerts-demo) Tj ET
BT /F3 9 Tf 62 400 Td (Grafana -> Prometheus + Loki + Tempo) Tj ET
BT /F3 9 Tf 62 386 Td (DORA Exporter -> Prometheus) Tj ET
